WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.835
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:06.105 --> 00:08.224
You can formally introduce yourselves later.

3
00:08.305 --> 00:11.785
This is Phatee. He'll be A-Team's main vocalist.

4
00:15.585 --> 00:16.425
Good.

5
00:16.505 --> 00:17.585
Let's make this the debut song.

6
00:20.705 --> 00:23.265
Thanks for working so hard. For doing something you're not good at.

7
00:23.345 --> 00:25.065
I'll be right by your side.

8
00:25.145 --> 00:26.265
And I'll push you forward.

9
00:27.065 --> 00:29.505
You've always been an inspiration to me.

10
00:30.745 --> 00:32.224
Did you know me before?

11
00:40.345 --> 00:46.825
RANNE

12
01:06.465 --> 01:07.785
How did you get in?

13
01:12.985 --> 01:14.785
Well, was it your friend?

14
01:15.425 --> 01:16.585
The one named Tangmo.

15
01:17.145 --> 01:18.585
He told me to wait up here.

16
01:28.545 --> 01:29.945
We went to the same school.

17
01:31.745 --> 01:33.105
You never told me.

18
01:33.905 --> 01:36.545
Is that why you knew I was your senior?

19
01:39.345 --> 01:40.345
No.

20
01:41.145 --> 01:42.785
I don't remember either.

21
01:47.745 --> 01:48.585
Really?

22
01:50.705 --> 01:51.825
Really.

23
01:52.345 --> 01:54.025
It was a long time ago.

24
01:59.105 --> 02:00.385
Then why…

25
02:04.185 --> 02:05.705
did you give me flowers back then?

26
02:07.225 --> 02:09.705
This looks like the handwriting of someone who gave me flowers.

27
02:22.105 --> 02:24.945
You don't give flowers to everyone, do you?

28
02:28.865 --> 02:30.705
Why did you give me flowers and then disappear?

29
02:31.905 --> 02:34.105
It was a long time ago.

30
02:35.305 --> 02:37.665
I think you've got me confused with someone else.

31
02:44.385 --> 02:45.385
Do you like me?

32
02:47.025 --> 02:48.665
This is getting out of hand.

33
02:49.625 --> 02:50.945
You've got it wrong.

34
02:52.105 --> 02:53.545
I've never liked you.

35
02:59.545 --> 03:00.505
So…

36
03:01.905 --> 03:03.225
Why are you here?

37
03:04.465 --> 03:05.665
I was worried about you.

38
03:06.185 --> 03:07.425
You just disappeared.

39
03:07.505 --> 03:08.665
I couldn't reach you.

40
03:08.745 --> 03:10.265
So I came to see you.

41
04:26.505 --> 04:28.545
Do you guys really think it'll work?

42
04:29.945 --> 04:32.305
Tomorrow's the deadline Kao gave us.

43
04:32.385 --> 04:33.505
Hey.

44
04:33.585 --> 04:35.545
If we don't try, we'll never know, right?

45
04:38.545 --> 04:41.065
Where's Phatee? Why isn't he here?

46
04:43.465 --> 04:44.665
You guys carry on for me.

47
04:44.745 --> 04:45.985
Okay.

48
04:56.225 --> 04:57.665
Phatee, is something wrong?

49
04:58.745 --> 05:00.225
Saw won't come back

50
05:00.745 --> 05:02.465
if you keep using AI songs.

51
05:03.185 --> 05:04.345
Stop using AI.

52
05:04.425 --> 05:05.825
I can't.

53
05:06.345 --> 05:08.425
The song's already finalized.

54
05:08.505 --> 05:10.785
And… if Saw doesn't come back,

55
05:10.865 --> 05:12.025
the four of you can debut.

56
05:13.505 --> 05:16.425
I can't sing a song written by AI either.

57
05:16.505 --> 05:18.825
It doesn't have the same meaning as one written by a real person.

58
05:18.905 --> 05:20.385
What do you mean?

59
05:20.945 --> 05:22.705
If the band doesn't have you,

60
05:23.225 --> 05:24.545
I'll have to disband it.

61
05:30.225 --> 05:32.225
I really can't escape you guys.

62
05:32.305 --> 05:34.025
Whoa, Saw!

63
05:34.105 --> 05:35.665
I missed you. Where have you been for days?

64
05:35.745 --> 05:36.865
Miss you, Bro.

65
05:36.945 --> 05:38.505
Miss you, Bro.

66
05:39.145 --> 05:41.705
You're overdoing it, farang. It's only been a few days.

67
05:41.785 --> 05:43.585
And you're acting like… Jeez.

68
05:43.665 --> 05:45.905
You call me farang? Look at yourself.

69
05:47.505 --> 05:48.865
You both look fucking farang.

70
05:49.945 --> 05:51.265
Got you there.

71
05:53.345 --> 05:54.625
How did you guys know I was here?

72
05:57.785 --> 05:58.985
Phatee, huh?

73
06:01.105 --> 06:03.225
If we hadn't come all the way here for you,

74
06:03.305 --> 06:04.985
would you have come back?

75
06:07.625 --> 06:08.905
Just because you came

76
06:09.985 --> 06:11.665
doesn't mean I'm going back.

77
06:15.745 --> 06:17.065
Besides,

78
06:17.905 --> 06:20.705
no matter what, Kao doesn't care about me anyway.

79
06:24.545 --> 06:27.665
She only cares about you and Phatee.

80
06:27.745 --> 06:29.265
Hey, Saw.

81
06:30.265 --> 06:31.985
How could Kao not care about you?

82
06:32.505 --> 06:34.225
She cares about all of us.

83
06:34.825 --> 06:37.265
And even if she really doesn't care about you,

84
06:37.345 --> 06:39.185
fuck it.

85
06:39.265 --> 06:40.665
Everyone here

86
06:40.745 --> 06:41.985
cares about you.

87
06:58.705 --> 06:59.625
I don't know.

88
07:01.025 --> 07:02.825
if Kao still uses AI songs,

89
07:03.625 --> 07:04.785
I'm out.

90
07:50.905 --> 07:53.145
Even if I go back, you'll still use AI songs.

91
07:53.745 --> 07:56.065
That's definitely not happening.

92
07:56.145 --> 07:58.105
Otherwise, why would I come all the way here?

93
07:59.025 --> 08:01.465
I'll give you the freedom to make your music.

94
08:01.545 --> 08:04.585
I won't let AI interfere with your work again.

95
08:04.665 --> 08:05.545
I promise.

96
08:11.985 --> 08:13.385
Trust me.

97
08:13.945 --> 08:15.705
I understand you guys now.

98
08:23.185 --> 08:24.305
If you mean it,

99
08:26.945 --> 08:28.065
I'm okay with it.

100
08:28.665 --> 08:29.825
Yes!

101
08:31.105 --> 08:32.065
You'd better mean it.

102
08:32.144 --> 08:34.385
But I'm not postponing your debut.

103
08:34.904 --> 08:37.264
Hurry and practice for the debut stage.

104
08:37.345 --> 08:38.945
Sure.

105
08:40.825 --> 08:41.664
Piece of cake.

106
08:49.625 --> 08:51.865
Come on, you guys. Hug it out.

107
08:51.945 --> 08:55.065
You're happy, aren't you? Come on.

108
08:56.665 --> 08:59.185
You need to practice when you get back, Saw.

109
09:08.305 --> 09:15.265
Oh-ooh-woah, can I whisper it softly?

110
09:15.345 --> 09:19.505
Can I whisper it softly to your ear

111
09:19.585 --> 09:22.505
That I love you?

112
09:27.465 --> 09:29.785
How is it, guys? Anything you want to change?

113
09:29.865 --> 09:32.025
-I'm good with it. -It's good.

114
09:32.105 --> 09:34.145
And for our debut song,

115
09:34.225 --> 09:36.225
do we need to dance to show people it's danceable?

116
09:37.185 --> 09:40.345
This song focuses on vocals. Let's try…

117
09:40.425 --> 09:42.745
moving between positions and entertaining the crowd instead.

118
09:42.825 --> 09:45.505
For the hook, we'll find some easy-to-remember moves.

119
09:47.185 --> 09:48.145
What do you guys think?

120
09:50.265 --> 09:52.385
-Let's try it. -Okay.

121
09:53.185 --> 09:54.345
Then…

122
09:55.345 --> 09:56.385
let's do what Phatee said.

123
09:58.105 --> 10:00.225
Wow, when you talk to Phatee,

124
10:00.305 --> 10:01.825
your voice is so sweet.

125
10:01.905 --> 10:03.265
But when you talk to us…

126
10:03.785 --> 10:05.945
True. Phatee too.

127
10:06.025 --> 10:07.105
He's so different

128
10:07.185 --> 10:08.385
when he talks to Ranne.

129
10:08.985 --> 10:10.305
You guys are acting suspicious.

130
10:11.345 --> 10:14.065
I've been gone for three days. Did I miss something?

131
10:14.785 --> 10:17.265
Knock it off. You know why?

132
10:17.345 --> 10:20.385
Because Phatee isn't rude to me like you guys are.

133
10:20.945 --> 10:22.425
All right, keep practicing.

134
10:22.505 --> 10:24.585
Okay, don't get mad to cover it up.

135
10:24.665 --> 10:25.825
I'm not mad.

136
10:26.465 --> 10:28.225
Come on. Let's practice.

137
10:37.185 --> 10:39.225
If this band doesn't have you,

138
10:39.745 --> 10:41.305
I'll have to disband it.

139
10:42.625 --> 10:44.705
And if I agree to work as a pair with Ranne,

140
10:45.585 --> 10:48.385
will you let us write our own songs again?

141
11:04.385 --> 11:07.145
From now on, post behind-the-scenes rehearsal clips

142
11:07.225 --> 11:09.305
of Phatee and Ranne every day.

143
11:09.905 --> 11:12.745
Keep it natural. Don't push it too hard.

144
11:12.825 --> 11:16.105
If the fans like it, they'll hype them up themselves.

145
11:18.465 --> 11:19.625
Kao.

146
11:19.705 --> 11:23.105
I wanted to tell you that our channel right now,

147
11:23.185 --> 11:25.825
especially the clips of Phatee and Ranne,

148
11:25.905 --> 11:27.585
are getting millions of views.

149
11:27.665 --> 11:29.905
More views than any other member.

150
11:30.705 --> 11:32.425
If being a group causes so many problems,

151
11:32.505 --> 11:35.345
why not debut these two as a duo?

152
11:37.185 --> 11:38.905
Phatee and Ranne won't agree to that.

153
11:39.585 --> 11:40.825
Besides,

154
11:40.905 --> 11:43.145
if we're going to make someone stand out,

155
11:43.705 --> 11:45.105
we need some supporting players.

156
11:49.265 --> 11:51.105
Want a drink? I'm about to order.

157
11:51.625 --> 11:53.265
No, thanks. Go ahead.

158
11:53.345 --> 11:54.905
Where are the others?

159
11:55.905 --> 11:58.865
PJ and Tonhon took Phatee over there to film a TikTok.

160
12:02.505 --> 12:04.505
So…

161
12:04.585 --> 12:06.225
what's going on with you and Phatee?

162
12:06.305 --> 12:07.185
Are you two flirting?

163
12:08.665 --> 12:09.625
What flirting?

164
12:09.705 --> 12:10.985
He's just a junior in the band.

165
12:12.345 --> 12:14.745
I believe you don't feel anything.

166
12:15.345 --> 12:16.465
It's just content.

167
12:16.985 --> 12:18.625
Kao's pushing you two anyway.

168
12:20.825 --> 12:21.825
But Phatee?

169
12:21.905 --> 12:23.345
I'm not so sure.

170
12:24.585 --> 12:26.385
I think he seems normal.

171
12:27.545 --> 12:29.225
How does he seem normal?

172
12:29.305 --> 12:30.985
The way he looks at you

173
12:31.505 --> 12:33.745
isn't how he looks at other people.

174
12:34.265 --> 12:36.545
He seems to care about you a lot.

175
12:41.465 --> 12:43.665
-Really? -Yeah.

176
12:45.745 --> 12:47.465
How do you feel about him?

177
12:56.505 --> 12:57.505
Well…

178
12:58.825 --> 13:00.145
he's pretty cute.

179
13:00.945 --> 13:01.945
Nice smile.

180
13:03.065 --> 13:04.465
Good at guitar.

181
13:05.545 --> 13:07.025
And he sings well.

182
13:08.065 --> 13:09.625
But he's a bit too private.

183
13:10.945 --> 13:12.345
Still, I don't know why.

184
13:12.905 --> 13:15.785
When I'm with him, I feel comfortable.

185
13:17.585 --> 13:18.905
Do you like him?

186
13:22.305 --> 13:25.105
He's okay. He's a sweet little brother.

187
13:26.225 --> 13:27.985
What about as a boyfriend?

188
13:36.665 --> 13:39.505
RANNE

189
13:46.505 --> 13:48.225
Hey, perfect timing.

190
13:48.825 --> 13:49.785
Tonhon, PJ, come here.

191
13:49.865 --> 13:51.545
-What? -I'm about to order drinks.

192
13:51.625 --> 13:53.025
What do you guys want?

193
13:53.625 --> 13:54.825
Longan juice.

194
13:54.905 --> 13:57.225
Longan juice. Same as you.

195
13:57.305 --> 13:58.665
What do you want?

196
13:59.425 --> 14:01.505
Lime soda.

197
14:01.585 --> 14:04.305
No lime soda, only longan. So two longan juices, okay?

198
14:04.385 --> 14:06.185
-Hey. -Phatee, what do you want?

199
14:06.265 --> 14:08.105
I'll have an Americano.

200
14:08.185 --> 14:09.385
Hot or iced?

201
14:09.465 --> 14:10.465
Iced.

202
14:10.545 --> 14:12.345
Light, medium, or dark roast?

203
14:13.425 --> 14:15.505
-Dark roast. -Okay.

204
14:16.265 --> 14:19.305
Two longan juices. Americano…

205
14:19.385 --> 14:20.625
Let's make it two.

206
14:21.785 --> 14:23.025
Four drinks total.

207
14:24.065 --> 14:25.185
Give me a sec.

208
14:27.065 --> 14:31.505
TONHON

209
14:32.345 --> 14:34.265
SAW

210
14:35.305 --> 14:39.545
PJ

211
14:41.425 --> 14:43.585
RANNE

212
14:44.785 --> 14:48.745
PHATEE

213
14:48.825 --> 14:53.185
My world looks so dark and gloomy

214
14:53.265 --> 14:59.785
When people stare, I just crumble so I run away

215
14:59.865 --> 15:05.025
Far from the crowd, just me Oh, no

216
15:05.785 --> 15:09.545
I try not to feel anything

217
15:09.625 --> 15:13.625
But my heart never listens

218
15:13.705 --> 15:18.625
I can't bear it The sound of my heart's been so loud

219
15:18.705 --> 15:21.465
Ever since you came

220
15:21.545 --> 15:25.865
Too scared to say I love you

221
15:25.945 --> 15:29.345
Just being near you is enough

222
15:29.425 --> 15:33.505
I wouldn't dare to get closer to you

223
15:33.585 --> 15:39.825
But what can I do? I'm in love with you

224
15:39.905 --> 15:43.785
-Should I shout it out? -I wouldn't dare

225
15:43.865 --> 15:46.385
I wouldn't dare

226
15:47.665 --> 15:54.025
Can I whisper it softly To your ear instead?

227
15:55.505 --> 15:59.825
I hate talking and making eye contact, But I like it when you look over at me

228
15:59.905 --> 16:03.145
I don't want to think or dream, But every night there's only you

229
16:03.225 --> 16:05.345
Didn't want to care, scared it's getting real

230
16:05.425 --> 16:07.585
But god, I really like you

231
16:07.665 --> 16:09.585
Don't want love, don't want any attachment

232
16:09.665 --> 16:11.385
But when you smile, my heart almost shatters

233
16:11.465 --> 16:13.185
Oh-ooh-whoa-oh

234
16:17.065 --> 16:19.065
You really don't have to walk me back.

235
16:20.585 --> 16:22.905
Well… it's dark.

236
16:26.745 --> 16:27.625
It's dark?

237
16:30.505 --> 16:33.465
I've walked alone for years. Nothing's ever happened.

238
16:34.305 --> 16:35.585
Just let me walk you back.

239
16:35.665 --> 16:36.905
It's for the best.

240
16:41.505 --> 16:42.825
Seriously.

241
16:42.905 --> 16:45.265
I only said I'd carry your bag.

242
16:45.825 --> 16:48.145
So you're not even going to help me carry it?

243
16:49.745 --> 16:52.785
You're the one who said you wanted to carry it.

244
16:52.865 --> 16:54.265
I'm just respecting that.

245
16:55.905 --> 16:57.825
Come on, give it to me.

246
17:04.745 --> 17:05.985
I was kidding.

247
17:06.065 --> 17:07.665
I wasn't going to make you carry it.

248
17:08.305 --> 17:09.704
I was just teasing you.

249
17:11.265 --> 17:12.265
Okay.

250
17:13.665 --> 17:16.145
So… which one's your car?

251
17:16.745 --> 17:17.944
Here.

252
17:18.025 --> 17:19.145
This one?

253
17:20.944 --> 17:22.464
Let me put my stuff away first.

254
17:44.625 --> 17:45.665
What's wrong?

255
17:48.345 --> 17:49.425
Nothing.

256
17:52.705 --> 17:54.025
It's pretty late.

257
17:54.585 --> 17:55.865
Want to stay at my place?

258
17:56.385 --> 17:57.305
I don't mind.

259
17:57.385 --> 17:58.825
But I do.

260
17:59.745 --> 18:00.665
What's the problem?

261
18:02.905 --> 18:04.185
I…

262
18:04.265 --> 18:06.025
don't like sleeping at other people's places.

263
18:08.145 --> 18:10.265
I'll take you home.

264
18:10.785 --> 18:11.945
Then I'll head back.

265
18:13.545 --> 18:15.265
Okay. Let's do that.

266
18:16.345 --> 18:17.745
Get in the car.

267
18:18.305 --> 18:19.505
Come on, let's get in.

268
18:38.545 --> 18:41.145
Oh. Rakkhun didn't come with you?

269
18:41.225 --> 18:43.385
Why are you alone today, Vann?

270
18:43.465 --> 18:45.225
He has things to do too.

271
18:45.305 --> 18:46.545
Unlike you.

272
18:46.625 --> 18:49.425
All you do is work out and hang out with Yoyeh.

273
18:49.505 --> 18:52.385
-Want these muscles to pound you, Vann? -He's getting violent again. Look, Talay.

274
18:52.465 --> 18:53.985
-Don't pick on him, Tangmo. -Get off me!

275
18:55.105 --> 18:56.185
Want some more?

276
18:59.505 --> 19:01.945
Phatee. How are you?

277
19:02.025 --> 19:03.185
Are you a singer yet?

278
19:03.265 --> 19:04.505
Yeah.

279
19:04.585 --> 19:06.265
I've seen you practicing hard every day.

280
19:07.945 --> 19:09.225
I'm performing in two days.

281
19:09.305 --> 19:10.265
Let me know if anyone wants to come.

282
19:13.065 --> 19:14.345
Your debut stage?

283
19:15.945 --> 19:18.225
My big bro is finally blowing up.

284
19:18.865 --> 19:20.385
I'll take a photo to show off.

285
19:20.465 --> 19:23.665
Damn, that's awesome. I have an artist for a friend now.

286
19:25.305 --> 19:26.545
I'm happy for you.

287
19:27.065 --> 19:28.825
You finally achieved your dream.

288
19:30.345 --> 19:32.265
The song isn't out yet, so it doesn't count.

289
19:32.905 --> 19:34.145
I don't know if it'll turn out well.

290
19:35.825 --> 19:37.465
Hey.

291
19:37.545 --> 19:38.825
What are you worried about?

292
19:39.665 --> 19:41.265
You've worked this hard.

293
19:41.345 --> 19:42.785
It has to turn out well.

294
19:43.825 --> 19:44.785
Yeah.

295
19:45.385 --> 19:46.585
You'll do great.

296
19:46.665 --> 19:48.865
As for whether it'll blow up or not,

297
19:48.945 --> 19:50.465
you can't control that.

298
19:50.545 --> 19:52.665
Sometimes good stuff just doesn't blow up.

299
19:52.745 --> 19:53.745
True.

300
19:54.305 --> 19:56.865
But you've got me. What are you afraid of?

301
19:56.945 --> 19:59.145
I'll get bots to boost your views.

302
19:59.225 --> 20:01.665
Let's get you to ten million views. Want that?

303
20:02.425 --> 20:03.425
No need.

304
20:04.665 --> 20:06.665
But I've seen the buzz on social media.

305
20:07.225 --> 20:10.385
They're glued to it, waiting for Phatee-Ranne moments.

306
20:12.025 --> 20:13.545
I sing. I'm not selling moments.

307
20:30.745 --> 20:32.105
The opportunity is here.

308
20:33.985 --> 20:35.665
You have to seize it.

309
20:38.065 --> 20:39.665
Which one do you mean?

310
20:40.345 --> 20:41.785
I mean both.

311
20:41.865 --> 20:44.185
Your dream and your love life.

312
20:46.305 --> 20:47.665
If you let them slip away,

313
20:47.745 --> 20:49.665
I won't know what else to say.

314
20:53.305 --> 20:54.825
Come on, let's take a photo.

315
20:54.905 --> 20:56.745
-Come on. -Let's do it.

316
21:00.305 --> 21:03.225
-Boost, boost, boost! -So handsome.

317
21:04.025 --> 21:05.785
-Hey. -Hey, why aren't you smiling?

318
21:05.865 --> 21:07.305
Let's take another one.

319
21:08.625 --> 21:09.745
Smile a little.

320
21:10.825 --> 21:11.865
Smile.

321
21:17.625 --> 21:19.065
Ranne.

322
21:21.625 --> 21:22.785
Vann.

323
21:23.705 --> 21:25.905
Rakkhun, why are you wearing a suit?

324
21:26.545 --> 21:29.585
You said we were going on a date, so I dressed up a little.

325
21:29.665 --> 21:31.585
You look cute in anything.

326
21:31.665 --> 21:33.265
-Let's go. -Let's go.

327
21:38.145 --> 21:39.785
Wow.

328
21:40.785 --> 21:42.225
This is a pretty big event.

329
21:42.945 --> 21:44.865
I've never been to anything like this.

330
21:45.545 --> 21:46.665
Of course.

331
21:46.745 --> 21:49.945
It's super exclusive. There are only 50 seats.

332
21:50.025 --> 21:51.185
Really?

333
21:51.265 --> 21:53.545
Let's take a photo with Phatee's standee.

334
21:59.665 --> 22:01.345
So handsome.

335
22:06.025 --> 22:07.025
Here.

336
22:07.945 --> 22:08.985
What's this?

337
22:09.625 --> 22:10.865
Earplugs.

338
22:10.945 --> 22:12.105
I brought them for you.

339
22:12.185 --> 22:14.505
It's over 120 decibels inside.

340
22:14.585 --> 22:16.785
I'm worried it could damage your eardrums.

341
22:17.985 --> 22:20.025
Wow, you're being dramatic.

342
22:20.665 --> 22:23.065
But… thanks.

343
22:24.185 --> 22:26.265
You're the sweetest.

344
22:29.545 --> 22:31.705
I'm your boyfriend. I have to take care of you.

345
22:37.145 --> 22:38.545
Want to take a photo with the standee?

346
22:39.145 --> 22:40.625
-Sure. -Let's go.

347
22:43.425 --> 22:44.785
I'll take one with Ranne.

348
22:44.865 --> 22:46.185
What about Phatee?

349
22:46.265 --> 22:47.345
Phatee can wait.

350
22:55.105 --> 22:56.545
Come see me when you're done.

351
22:56.625 --> 22:58.305
Thanks, Fam.

352
22:58.385 --> 23:04.025
Meeting you means everything, everything If you feel the same

353
23:04.105 --> 23:06.825
Just tell me if you feel the same

354
23:06.905 --> 23:12.025
Just tell me, oh-ooh-woah-oh

355
23:12.105 --> 23:15.665
'Cause you mean everything, everything If you feel--

356
23:37.825 --> 23:39.025
Who are you cursing at?

357
23:39.705 --> 23:40.745
I've been watching you for a while.

358
23:41.345 --> 23:42.625
Some asshole.

359
23:42.705 --> 23:45.665
They keep trashing Phatee on X, saying he only serves Ranne moments

360
23:45.745 --> 23:46.825
