362
23:49.225 --> 23:50.785
They're gonna get it from me.

363
23:51.385 --> 23:52.585
That's how it is when you're famous.

364
23:52.665 --> 23:54.705
Some people like him, and some don't.

365
23:54.785 --> 23:56.585
