366
23:56.665 --> 23:58.785
I can. I can do it.

367
23:58.865 --> 24:00.665
I could curse them out all day.

368
24:01.305 --> 24:04.065
So these assholes know how it feels to get cursed at.

369
24:04.145 --> 24:05.545
They picked the wrong person to mess with.

370
24:07.185 --> 24:08.625
You really haven't changed.

371
24:12.585 --> 24:14.065
Let's go see Phatee.

372
24:14.985 --> 24:16.145
What's with you?

373
24:16.825 --> 24:18.585
Didn't you say you'd watch the livestream?

374
24:19.185 --> 24:20.705
I don't really want to go.

375
24:20.785 --> 24:23.345
But the owner of this account might be at the event.

376
24:23.425 --> 24:25.065
So I can punch them in the face too.

377
24:26.425 --> 24:28.465
How will you know who owns the account?

378
24:30.385 --> 24:31.425
Right. True.

379
24:32.185 --> 24:33.025
I'll figure it out later.

380
24:33.105 --> 24:36.545
Anyway, I'll go film a prank on Phatee.

381
24:36.625 --> 24:37.785
What about the club?

382
24:37.865 --> 24:40.105
-Isn't there anyone to watch it? -Nay will be back soon.

383
24:40.185 --> 24:42.465
Come on. Let's hurry.

384
24:42.545 --> 24:43.905
It's about to start.

385
24:49.705 --> 24:50.665
Everyone.

386
24:51.385 --> 24:53.065
Just five more minutes.

387
24:56.785 --> 24:58.465
Why did you bring me here?

388
25:00.185 --> 25:01.465
I brought you here for research.

389
25:01.545 --> 25:03.265
You can use it in your novel.

390
25:03.345 --> 25:04.945
Try doing something new.

391
25:05.025 --> 25:06.345
It'll get your brain going.

392
25:07.385 --> 25:08.625
I don't really like it.

393
25:09.185 --> 25:10.185
Too many people.

394
25:10.265 --> 25:11.425
It's chaotic too.

395
25:13.185 --> 25:14.025
Where are you going?

396
25:14.665 --> 25:16.265
You're already here. Stay for a while.

397
25:16.865 --> 25:18.105
You're not that old yet.

398
25:18.745 --> 25:21.665
Stop acting like an old man who can't come up with ideas and

399
25:21.745 --> 25:23.865
does nothing but drink and smoke all day.

400
25:25.105 --> 25:26.505
Anything that clears my head

401
25:26.585 --> 25:28.785
and gives me ideas, I'll do it.

402
25:29.865 --> 25:30.745
But…

403
25:30.825 --> 25:32.865
I can't handle this.

404
25:32.945 --> 25:34.225
Too many people.

405
25:34.305 --> 25:35.625
I'm dizzy.

406
25:36.905 --> 25:38.425
Where are you going?

407
25:42.745 --> 25:44.945
Then just look at me, like this.

408
25:45.505 --> 25:46.505
Okay?

409
25:47.905 --> 25:49.665
Are you tricking me into looking at you?

410
25:51.825 --> 25:54.505
I don't need to. You already like looking at me.

411
25:57.185 --> 25:59.225
Don't be so full of yourself.

412
25:59.305 --> 26:01.345
You're just the model for my character.

413
26:01.425 --> 26:03.425
Of course I have to look at you. It helps me come up with ideas.

414
26:10.585 --> 26:11.425
By the way…

415
26:11.505 --> 26:13.785
do you like concerts like this?

416
26:15.225 --> 26:16.065
No.

417
26:16.145 --> 26:17.945
I don't usually go to them.

418
26:18.025 --> 26:20.025
But this is Phatee's debut concert.

419
26:21.225 --> 26:23.945
The singer who likes to sing with his back turned at The Crow Club.

420
26:26.905 --> 26:29.545
I was wondering why he hasn't been singing at the club lately.

421
26:31.225 --> 26:33.465
Phatee wants to be an artist.

422
26:33.545 --> 26:35.865
He's very talented.

423
26:35.945 --> 26:37.105
The problem is,

424
26:37.625 --> 26:38.825
he's a bit of an introvert.

425
26:39.345 --> 26:40.585
More than a bit.

426
26:40.665 --> 26:43.905
He sings with his back turned and ignores the audience.

427
26:44.825 --> 26:46.025
That's true.

428
26:46.105 --> 26:49.345
This is the first time he's dared to pursue his dream.

429
26:49.865 --> 26:51.785
So I wanted to come support him.

430
26:55.985 --> 26:56.945
Let's go.

431
26:57.025 --> 26:58.185
Let's go inside.

432
26:59.785 --> 27:00.785
You go ahead.

433
27:00.865 --> 27:02.265
Just try it. Come on.

434
27:13.025 --> 27:14.345
There you are.

435
27:16.105 --> 27:18.225
Everyone's looking for you.

436
27:18.305 --> 27:19.665
It's almost showtime.

437
27:25.505 --> 27:26.505
Are you nervous?

438
27:29.265 --> 27:30.265
Yeah.

439
27:32.865 --> 27:34.185
Then…

440
27:35.305 --> 27:38.305
try thinking of it like singing at the club.

441
27:39.025 --> 27:40.025
Would that help?

442
27:43.585 --> 27:45.665
How is it the same?

443
27:46.825 --> 27:48.425
There are way more people here.

444
27:54.585 --> 27:57.545
You don't… look nervous at all.

445
28:00.705 --> 28:01.665
Who told you that?

446
28:25.265 --> 28:26.385
Whoa.

447
28:27.225 --> 28:28.985
Your heart's beating so fast.

448
28:29.985 --> 28:31.305
