452
28:56.745 --> 28:58.105
It was a long time ago.

453
28:58.185 --> 28:59.345
Back then,

454
28:59.865 --> 29:01.625
I was this nervous too.

455
29:02.345 --> 29:04.185
My heart nearly gave out.

456
29:08.185 --> 29:11.065
But I still remember exactly how it all felt.

457
29:14.265 --> 29:15.945
The singing,

458
29:17.385 --> 29:18.745
the guitar,

459
29:20.105 --> 29:21.865
the sound of the crowd.

460
29:24.185 --> 29:25.825
I still remember it all.

461
29:29.265 --> 29:32.905
And I hope that someday,

462
29:33.665 --> 29:36.265
