474
30:32.385 --> 30:34.665
What do you want to happen?

475
30:36.745 --> 30:38.865
The singing onstage,

476
30:39.585 --> 30:41.625
the crowd screaming…

477
30:42.705 --> 30:45.425
Picture all those things in your mind.

478
30:46.905 --> 30:48.545
Make yourself feel like

479
30:49.105 --> 30:51.585
the moment you open your eyes,

480
30:52.185 --> 30:53.545
that dream

481
30:54.345 --> 30:56.345
will be right in front of you.

482
31:06.825 --> 31:07.985
You can open your eyes now.

483
31:10.105 --> 31:11.065
Phatee-Ranne!

484
31:11.665 --> 31:14.345
Phatee-Ranne! Phatee-Ranne!

485
31:14.425 --> 31:15.785
Phatee-Ranne!

486
31:15.865 --> 31:17.225
Phatee-Ranne!

487
31:17.305 --> 31:18.825
Phatee-Ranne!

488
31:18.905 --> 31:20.265
Phatee-Ranne!

489
31:22.305 --> 31:25.545
PHATEE - RANNE - SAW

