515
33:06.385 --> 33:07.905
Oh-ooh-woah-oh

516
33:07.985 --> 33:09.785
Meeting you means everything

517
33:09.865 --> 33:14.025
Everything, just tell me if you feel the same

518
33:14.105 --> 33:17.945
I try not to feel anything

519
33:18.025 --> 33:21.705
