34:04.745 --> 34:07.625
Oh-ooh-woah

530
34:07.705 --> 34:11.824
Can I whisper it softly?

531
34:12.905 --> 34:19.264
Oh-ooh-woah, oh-ooh-woah

532
34:20.744 --> 34:24.824
Oh-ooh-woah

533
34:24.905 --> 34:28.065
Oh-ooh-woah

534
34:28.145 --> 34:35.105
Can I whisper it softly to your ear That I love you?

