34:42.824 --> 34:45.705
-Phatee-Ranne! -Phatee-Ranne!

536
34:45.784 --> 34:47.425
Phatee-Ranne!

537
34:47.505 --> 34:48.905
Phatee-Ranne!

538
34:48.985 --> 34:50.545
Phatee-Ranne!

539
34:50.625 --> 34:52.264
Phatee-Ranne!

540
34:52.344 --> 34:53.784
You've seen the feedback, right?

541
34:53.865 --> 34:55.425
Your debut single

542
34:55.505 --> 34:58.665
