543
34:58.745 --> 34:59.665
Yeah.

544
34:59.745 --> 35:01.265
It even trended on X.

545
35:01.865 --> 35:05.185
Yeah. And that's just one song.

546
35:05.865 --> 35:08.065
At first, I was just going to use this song to test the market,

547
35:08.145 --> 35:10.105
but the feedback was better than expected.

548
35:10.185 --> 35:11.705
I've changed the plan.

549
35:12.305 --> 35:14.385
You'll release an album.

550
35:14.465 --> 35:15.465
So you can have a concert soon.

551
35:16.625 --> 35:17.465
An album?

552
35:17.545 --> 35:19.505
-Did I hear that right? -We're getting a concert too?

553
35:19.585 --> 35:21.985
-An album? -Really?

554
35:22.065 --> 35:24.065
We're getting an album?

555
35:24.145 --> 35:25.145
Yes.

556
35:25.865 --> 35:28.705
Well… you can go get some rest.

557
35:28.785 --> 35:30.345
I'll update the schedule.

558
35:30.425 --> 35:32.985
Things will be pretty hectic from now on.

559
35:33.065 --> 35:34.625
Bring it on.

560
35:36.425 --> 35:37.425
Let's go.

561
35:37.945 --> 35:39.785
-Mookata. Let's go. -Let's get some.

562
35:39.865 --> 35:41.385
Phatee and Ranne, stay for a bit.

563
35:42.745 --> 35:45.025
I need to talk about endorsement deals.

564
35:45.105 --> 35:47.025
