565
35:47.105 --> 35:49.105
-You two, sit down. -Okay.

566
35:51.425 --> 35:52.305
Kao.

567
35:53.545 --> 35:54.665
Just the two of them?

568
35:55.625 --> 35:57.385
The clients only picked those two.

569
36:02.745 --> 36:03.585
Let's go.

570
36:03.665 --> 36:05.305
-Can you pass me the iPad? -Sure.

571
36:10.585 --> 36:12.905
It'll look something like this.

572
36:13.425 --> 36:16.345
Look. Today I'm discussing the details.

573
36:20.465 --> 36:23.705
And this one, the scope is roughly this. They told me

574
36:23.785 --> 36:25.105
it should be like this.

575
36:25.185 --> 36:27.425
This is roughly the overall theme, right?

576
36:27.505 --> 36:29.865
-Cheers! -Cheers!

577
36:33.545 --> 36:34.625
Tastes heavenly.

578
36:34.705 --> 36:35.585
So refreshing.

579
36:38.745 --> 36:41.225
Seriously, it's nice to eat like this once in a while.

580
36:41.985 --> 36:43.585
Yeah. It reminds me of the old days.

581
36:43.665 --> 36:45.545
We used to order this almost every week.

582
36:46.305 --> 36:48.665
But now, I have to watch my weight.

583
36:48.745 --> 36:50.185
Come on, you don't need to.

584
36:50.265 --> 36:51.905
I'm already too exhausted to go home.

585
36:51.985 --> 36:53.545
Just eat. You'll lose weight anyway.

586
36:54.225 --> 36:55.465
Yeah, I agree.

587
36:56.465 --> 36:58.505
What the hell? You're eating it all.

588
36:58.585 --> 37:00.345
-Hey, that… -Should we order another set?

589
37:00.425 --> 37:01.585
Don't you like eating this?

590
37:01.665 --> 37:03.945
Can I get a photo with Phatee and Ranne?

591
37:04.025 --> 37:05.945
Please, please, please!

592
37:06.025 --> 37:07.425
Please, you two.

593
37:07.505 --> 37:08.865
-Sure. -Please.

594
37:08.945 --> 37:10.665
-Let me go first. -Okay, I'll take it for you.

595
37:10.745 --> 37:11.665
I want to be in the middle.

596
37:12.465 --> 37:13.545
Go ahead.

597
37:16.745 --> 37:19.825
One, two, three.

598
37:19.905 --> 37:21.865
One, two, three.

599
37:22.785 --> 37:24.385
So cute. I want one too.

600
37:24.465 --> 37:25.705
Take one for me.

601
37:27.265 --> 37:29.385
One, two, three.

602
37:29.465 --> 37:30.465
Aw.

603
37:30.545 --> 37:32.145
Can I take a photo of you two?

604
37:32.225 --> 37:34.385
-I want one of you together. -Move closer together.

605
37:34.465 --> 37:36.385
-Do this pose. -Do this pose.

606
37:36.465 --> 37:37.505
-Just like this. -Okay.

607
37:37.585 --> 37:39.625
Move closer together.

608
37:39.705 --> 37:40.825
Just like that.

609
37:40.905 --> 37:43.065
Phatee, do it.

610
37:44.265 --> 37:45.585
One, two, three.

611
37:46.105 --> 37:47.385
Thank you so much.

612
37:47.465 --> 37:49.025
-Thanks. -Okay, thanks.

613
37:49.625 --> 37:50.625
This photo is so cute.

614
37:51.785 --> 37:52.785
Come on.

615
38:00.265 --> 38:01.545
We're almost out of pork.

616
38:11.905 --> 38:13.705
What's with you guys?

617
38:13.785 --> 38:15.465
Why is the mood like this?

618
38:16.025 --> 38:18.025
We're about to have our first album.

619
38:19.545 --> 38:20.905
Cheer up, guys.

620
38:20.985 --> 38:23.225
Hey. Tonhon.

621
38:24.025 --> 38:24.985
PJ.

622
38:25.065 --> 38:26.305
Honestly,

623
38:27.545 --> 38:31.625
right now, I don't know if our band is selling music or shipping.

624
38:32.825 --> 38:36.025
Honestly, onstage, you only need the two of you.

625
38:36.105 --> 38:38.065
People don't fucking come to see us.

626
38:41.665 --> 38:44.985
I get that it's Kao's marketing strategy.

627
38:46.305 --> 38:48.785
But I… can't help feeling the same as Tonhon.

628
38:50.705 --> 38:52.145
Did you see that just now?

629
38:52.225 --> 38:54.585
A fan asked for a photo with just you two.

630
38:54.665 --> 38:56.505
If this keeps happening,

631
38:58.305 --> 38:59.945
it feels like we're just extras.

632
39:12.625 --> 39:14.545
I understand where you guys are coming from.

633
39:15.945 --> 39:17.505
But don't forget

634
39:18.105 --> 39:20.385
that I dragged you guys into this band

635
39:20.465 --> 39:22.145
because of your talent.

636
39:23.065 --> 39:24.025
I…

637
39:24.105 --> 39:26.225
want more people to discover you guys.

638
39:30.385 --> 39:32.585
Even if I have to use the buzz around

639
39:32.665 --> 39:33.745
me and Phatee as a ship

640
39:35.145 --> 39:37.665
to get engagement and draw people to our music first,

641
39:38.665 --> 39:39.705
I'm willing to do it.

642
39:42.705 --> 39:44.065
Because my dream

643
39:45.345 --> 39:48.505
is to keep making music with you guys.

644
39:52.545 --> 39:54.225
Even if right now

645
39:54.985 --> 39:58.865
people like our band because of the ship or the label's content,

646
39:58.945 --> 40:01.145
trust me, guys.

647
40:01.225 --> 40:06.465
One day, people will realize that our music

648
40:06.985 --> 40:08.345
is so fucking good.

649
40:09.105 --> 40:09.945
The best.

650
40:11.065 --> 40:12.105
Know why?

651
40:13.065 --> 40:15.705
Because we're the fucking best.

652
40:15.785 --> 40:16.945
Yeah.

653
40:17.545 --> 40:18.665
-Cheers! -Cheers!

654
40:18.745 --> 40:20.025
Cheers!

655
40:21.065 --> 40:23.705
You really found an excuse to toast again.

656
40:27.665 --> 40:29.585
Let me get one good "ahh."

657
40:31.905 --> 40:32.985
Awesome.

658
40:33.585 --> 40:34.625
Order more.

659
40:35.385 --> 40:37.665
Excuse me. We're out of pork. One more set, please.

660
40:37.745 --> 40:38.865
Get another set.

661
40:54.505 --> 40:56.105
I want the two of us

662
40:56.185 --> 40:58.225
to keep being paired up.

663
41:04.025 --> 41:06.505
You've been coming into my room too often.

664
41:17.865 --> 41:20.545
Your friends are the ones who let me come up.

665
41:22.265 --> 41:23.585
So what do you want to do?

666
41:24.345 --> 41:25.945
Will you promise me

667
41:26.025 --> 41:27.865
we'll keep being paired up

668
41:27.945 --> 41:29.425
until our band blows up?

669
41:32.345 --> 41:33.785
Don't you think

670
41:34.705 --> 41:36.185
without the ship,

671
41:36.745 --> 41:39.905
people might focus more on the members' talent?

672
41:44.785 --> 41:46.465
But then again,

673
41:47.345 --> 41:49.625
we're not exactly just a ship.

674
41:51.865 --> 41:54.625
I've never forced anything when I'm with you.

675
41:56.185 --> 41:57.425
What about you?

676
41:58.305 --> 41:59.985
Do you force anything when you're with me?

677
42:02.945 --> 42:04.185
Never.

678
42:05.745 --> 42:09.065
Then let's just be ourselves when we're together.

679
42:10.025 --> 42:11.665
We do what we want.

680
42:15.505 --> 42:17.105
We feel what we want to feel.

681
42:22.385 --> 42:23.505
Hey.

682
42:23.585 --> 42:24.585
Isn't this…

683
42:26.145 --> 42:27.185
a little too close?

684
42:29.145 --> 42:31.025
There are no cameras in here.

685
42:31.105 --> 42:32.665
You don't have to make content.

686
42:36.105 --> 42:37.425
I told you.

687
42:42.105 --> 42:43.465
We do what we want.

688
44:02.825 --> 44:04.145
Are you going to work?

689
44:05.225 --> 44:06.305
Eat first.

690
44:07.105 --> 44:08.945
-I made it for you. -Thanks.

691
44:25.025 --> 44:27.265
If I keep dreaming about the same person,

692
44:28.665 --> 44:29.785
what does it mean?

693
44:31.585 --> 44:33.345
What happens in your dreams?

694
44:36.425 --> 44:37.425
Well…

695
44:40.345 --> 44:42.105
we just talk.

696
44:44.385 --> 44:47.305
But… it feels so real I can barely tell the difference.

697
44:47.385 --> 44:48.865
You talk?

698
44:52.425 --> 44:54.225
The person you dream about…

699
44:54.305 --> 44:55.305
is Ranne, right?

700
45:00.425 --> 45:01.265
Yeah.

701
45:03.265 --> 45:04.145
It's…

702
45:04.825 --> 45:05.865
nothing.

703
45:06.545 --> 45:08.545
If you want to talk, just talk.

704
45:09.305 --> 45:10.545
If you don't, then don't.

705
45:12.385 --> 45:14.465
In the end, it's just a dream anyway.

706
45:14.545 --> 45:15.905
Right?

707
45:22.985 --> 45:24.145
You really just talk?

708
45:36.385 --> 45:37.865
-Are they coming? -Oh, I'm so excited!

709
45:37.945 --> 45:39.065
So excited!

710
45:39.145 --> 45:40.305
I can't wait.

711
45:40.385 --> 45:42.385
-I see them! -Phatee must look so handsome.

712
45:42.465 --> 45:43.905
They're here!

713
45:43.985 --> 45:45.265
They're here!

714
45:47.705 --> 45:48.745
Excuse us.

715
45:48.825 --> 45:51.665
-Don't forget to eat well. -Make way, please. Make way, please.

716
45:51.745 --> 45:52.985
Good luck, guys!

717
45:53.065 --> 45:54.865
-Please don't come closer. -Phatee!

718
45:54.945 --> 45:56.625
-Phatee! -Phatee!

719
45:56.705 --> 45:57.985
-Phatee! -You look so handsome!

720
45:58.065 --> 46:00.105
-Practice hard! -Please step back.

721
46:00.185 --> 46:01.585
-Phatee! -Phatee!

722
46:01.665 --> 46:03.905
-Good luck, Phatee! -Good luck, Phatee!

723
46:03.985 --> 46:05.025
You guys go in first.

724
46:06.305 --> 46:07.665
-Good luck, Phatee! -Phatee!

725
46:08.945 --> 46:10.665
-Phatee! -Please take my flowers!

726
46:10.745 --> 46:11.945
-Excuse us. -Excuse us.

727
46:12.025 --> 46:14.185
-Excuse us. -Phatee!

728
46:16.105 --> 46:17.945
-Bye! -Bye!

729
46:18.545 --> 46:19.785
Do you think it's good enough?

730
46:19.865 --> 46:22.225
I think so. It's good.

731
46:23.465 --> 46:24.465
You've got this.

732
46:25.585 --> 46:26.625
Okay.

733
46:27.305 --> 46:28.625
Phatee.

734
46:28.705 --> 46:30.745
Next time, don't accept things from fans yourself.

735
46:30.825 --> 46:32.785
Let the AR handle it, okay?

736
46:33.785 --> 46:36.065
Kao. It's my fault.

737
46:36.145 --> 46:37.265
I forgot to tell Phatee.

738
46:40.305 --> 46:43.185
Go discuss the project. Go.

739
46:43.785 --> 46:44.705
Okay.

740
46:47.905 --> 46:49.105
Shit! Tonhon!

741
46:49.185 --> 46:50.785
Our hashtag is number two!

742
46:50.865 --> 46:52.105
I want number one.

743
46:52.185 --> 46:53.825
-We're number two? -Let's boost the trend.

744
46:53.905 --> 46:55.265
-Let me find a photo to post. -Ranne, look at this.

745
46:56.425 --> 46:57.465
What am I looking at?

746
46:58.785 --> 46:59.745
Over ten thousand reposts.

747
47:00.865 --> 47:02.425
-Shit. -We're really number two?

748
47:02.505 --> 47:03.425
Yeah.

749
47:04.025 --> 47:05.865
I can smell success.

750
47:05.945 --> 47:08.345
Damn, you look so good.

751
47:08.425 --> 47:09.425
Look at my jawline.

752
47:09.505 --> 47:10.945
-Damn. -Post this one.

753
47:11.025 --> 47:12.105
Post this one.

754
47:12.185 --> 47:15.265
-Post it. Let's get to number one. -Seriously?

755
47:15.345 --> 47:16.185
Guys.

756
47:16.825 --> 47:17.745
What?

757
47:18.745 --> 47:20.505
Have you seen the post on X?

758
47:20.585 --> 47:22.585
-Of course. They're everywhere. -Yeah.

759
47:22.665 --> 47:23.665
What post?

760
47:24.265 --> 47:25.505
This isn't good.

761
47:33.625 --> 47:35.425
Wake up, everyone.

762
47:35.505 --> 47:38.385
A newly debuted male idol with the initials P.T.

763
47:38.465 --> 47:43.105
who has a shipmate in his band that everyone keeps hyping up…

764
47:43.705 --> 47:45.425
"He's violent."

765
47:45.505 --> 47:47.705
"He once beat someone so badly they ended up in the hospital."

766
47:48.745 --> 47:50.705
"If my older brother, who's a doctor, hadn't helped him,

767
47:51.585 --> 47:53.145
he'd be in prison by now."

768
47:53.745 --> 47:54.945
"P.T."

769
47:55.465 --> 47:56.705
That's Phatee, right?

770
47:59.705 --> 48:01.025
There are photos and everything.

771
48:01.785 --> 48:03.425
That's got to be him.

772
48:13.345 --> 48:15.505
MISSALLSUNDAY: WAKE UP, EVERYONE.

773
48:59.785 --> 49:01.145
Just stop.

774
49:01.745 --> 49:02.985
You don't have to make content.

775
49:03.065 --> 49:04.865
You don't have to pretend you have feelings for me.

776
49:04.945 --> 49:05.785
Phatee.

777
49:05.865 --> 49:09.025
Everything that happened in your dreams was real.

778
49:09.785 --> 49:11.265
I really do like you.

779
49:12.345 --> 49:13.465
I'm not an artist anymore.

780
49:14.065 --> 49:15.185
I can't even sing at the club anymore.

781
49:16.225 --> 49:18.025
I think I should leave here.

782
49:18.105 --> 49:20.545
You have to find the owner of the Miss All Sunday account

783
49:20.625 --> 49:22.185
before you go back to Japan.

784
49:22.265 --> 49:23.785
Phatee's anti's account.

785
49:23.865 --> 49:26.745
This is the account that made the post saying Phatee beat someone up.

786
49:27.465 --> 49:28.865
I found the location of the account.
